ges.0.sentences.0.grammar.0.vi":"Indicates the number of people or group composition participating in an action (together with family).","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.0.grammar.1.vi":"Noun modification: the preceding clause modifies the noun (the hotel located in the mountains).","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.0.vi":"This summer, I stayed with my family at a hotel in the mountains.","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.0.vocab.0.vi":"this summer","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.0.vocab.1.vi":"I, me","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.0.vocab.2.vi":"family","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.0.vocab.3.vi":"in the mountains, deep in the mountains","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.0.vocab.4.vi":"be located, exist, be","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.0.vocab.5.vi":"hotel","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.0.vocab.6.vi":"stayed (overnight), lodged","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.1.grammar.0.vi":"Indicates the starting and ending points of a distance (from the station to the bus stop).","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.1.grammar.1.vi":"Placed after a quantity to indicate '... or more', 'more than...'.","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.1.vi":"From the station to the bus stop near the hotel, it took more than 2 hours by bus.","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.1.vocab.0.vi":"station, train station","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.1.vocab.1.vi":"hotel","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.1.vocab.2.vi":"near, nearby, vicinity","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.1.vocab.3.vi":"bus stop","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.1.vocab.4.vi":"bus","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.1.vocab.5.vi":"2 hours or more, more than 2 hours","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.1.vocab.6.vi":"took (time), cost","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.10.vi":"At night, the stars were very beautiful.","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.10.vocab.0.vi":"night, evening","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.10.vocab.1.vi":"star, stars","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.10.vocab.2.vi":"pretty, beautiful","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.11.grammar.0.vi":"Indicates that throughout the entire period the state in the preceding clause lasts (staying at the hotel), the actions in the following clause occur continuously or repeatedly.","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.11.grammar.1.vi":"A sentence pattern used to list representative actions (taking walks, swimming, catching bugs, taking naps).","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.11.vi":"During our stay at the hotel, every day we would all go for walks, swim in the lake, catch bugs, and take naps together.","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.11.vocab.0.vi":"hotel","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.11.vocab.1.vi":"to stay, to be (at a place)","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.11.vocab.10.vi":"catching (and such)","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.11.vocab.11.vi":"afternoon nap, nap","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.11.vocab.12.vi":"doing (things like)","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.11.vocab.13.vi":"did","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.11.vocab.2.vi":"while, during","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.11.vocab.3.vi":"every day, daily","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.11.vocab.4.vi":"everyone, all together","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.11.vocab.5.vi":"walk, stroll","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.11.vocab.6.vi":"doing (things like)","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.11.vocab.7.vi":"lake","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.11.vocab.8.vi":"swimming (and such)","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.11.vocab.9.vi":"insect, bug","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.12.vi":"We stayed at the hotel for 1 week.","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.12.vocab.0.vi":"hotel","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.12.vocab.1.vi":"one week, 1 week","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.13.grammar.0.vi":"Attaches to the verb stem (masu-form without masu) to express two actions occurring simultaneously (talking while returning home).","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.13.grammar.1.vi":"Uses the particle と to quote direct speech enclosed in 「」.","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.13.vi":"We returned home while saying, \"That was fun, wasn't it? ②Living like this once in a while is nice, too.\"","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.13.vocab.0.vi":"we, us","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.13.vocab.1.vi":"was fun, was enjoyable","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.13.vocab.2.vi":"this kind of, such, like this","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.13.vocab.3.vi":"life, living, daily life","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.13.vocab.4.vi":"occasionally, once in a while, sometimes","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.13.vocab.5.vi":"good, nice","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.13.vocab.6.vi":"while talking, while chatting","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.13.vocab.7.vi":"house, home","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.13.vocab.8.vi":"returned, went home","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.2.grammar.0.vi":"The particle を is used with motion verbs to indicate the route or space traversed.","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.2.grammar.1.vi":"Indicates an approximation approaching a specific point in time or quantity (almost 30 minutes).","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.2.vi":"From the bus stop to the hotel, we walked along a narrow road for nearly 30 minutes.","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.2.vocab.0.vi":"bus stop","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.2.vocab.1.vi":"hotel","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.2.vocab.2.vi":"narrow, thin, slender","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.2.vocab.3.vi":"road, street, path","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.2.vocab.4.vi":"nearly 30 minutes, almost 30 minutes","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.2.vocab.5.vi":"walked","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.3.grammar.0.vi":"Connects an い-adjective to another adjective to list multiple characteristics (both small and old).","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.3.grammar.1.vi":"Conjunction connecting two clauses with a contrasting or concessive meaning (although..., but...).","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.3.vi":"The hotel was small and old, but the inside was very clean.","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.3.vocab.0.vi":"hotel","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.3.vocab.1.vi":"small and","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.3.vocab.2.vi":"was old","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.3.vocab.3.vi":"inside, interior","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.3.vocab.4.vi":"very","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.3.vocab.5.vi":"clean, pretty, beautiful","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.4.grammar.0.vi":"Used with a negative ending to completely negate both items or options (neither).","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.4.vi":"However, this hotel has neither.","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.4.vocab.0.vi":"however, but","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.4.vocab.1.vi":"this","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.4.vocab.2.vi":"hotel","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.4.vocab.3.vi":"both, neither (with negative)","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.4.vocab.4.vi":"there is not, do not have","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.5.grammar.0.vi":"Lists items to emphasize that they all share the same negative state (neither... nor...).","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.5.vi":"Furthermore, there is neither a refrigerator nor an air conditioner.","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.5.vocab.0.vi":"and then, after that, in addition","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.5.vocab.1.vi":"refrigerator, fridge","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.5.vocab.2.vi":"air conditioner","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.5.vocab.3.vi":"there is not, do not have","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.6.grammar.0.vi":"Polite past negative form of な-adjectives and nouns (was not...).","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.6.grammar.1.vi":"Potential form of the verb する, expressing the ability to perform an action (was able to do).","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.6.vi":"This hotel was not convenient, but we were able to do many different things in the mountains and at the lake.","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.6.vocab.0.vi":"this","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.6.vocab.1.vi":"hotel","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.6.vocab.2.vi":"convenient, handy","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.6.vocab.3.vi":"was not, did not have, there was not","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.6.vocab.4.vi":"mountain","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.6.vocab.5.vi":"lake","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.6.vocab.6.vi":"various, all kinds of","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.6.vocab.7.vi":"thing, matter","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.6.vocab.8.vi":"could do, was able to do","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.7.grammar.0.vi":"Indicates that the action in the subsequent clause occurs immediately after, or as an inevitable result of, the action in the preceding clause (as soon as the window was opened, the breeze blew in).","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.7.grammar.1.vi":"Indicates movement toward the speaker or the space where the speaker is located (blowing into the room).","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.7.vi":"When I put my luggage in the room and opened the window, a cool breeze came in from the lake.","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.7.vocab.0.vi":"room","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.7.vocab.1.vi":"luggage, baggage","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.7.vocab.2.vi":"put, place","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.7.vocab.3.vi":"window","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.7.vocab.4.vi":"when opening, upon opening","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.7.vocab.5.vi":"lake","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.7.vocab.6.vi":"cool, refreshing","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.7.vocab.7.vi":"wind, breeze","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.7.vocab.8.vi":"came in, blew in","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.8.grammar.0.vi":"Expresses chronological sequence: performing the next action after completing the preceding one (after resting for a bit).","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.8.grammar.1.vi":"Indicates an objective, natural reason or cause (since it was still light outside).","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.8.grammar.2.vi":"Indicates the purpose of going out (going out for a walk).","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.8.vi":"After resting for a little while, since it was still light outside, I went out for a walk.","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.8.vocab.0.vi":"a little, a bit","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.8.vocab.1.vi":"after resting","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.8.vocab.2.vi":"was light, was bright","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.8.vocab.3.vi":"walk, stroll","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.8.vocab.4.vi":"went out","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.9.grammar.0.vi":"The te-form (て) of an i-adjective (い), used to list characteristics or states.","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.9.grammar.1.vi":"The particle も adds parallel information (the scenery was also beautiful).","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.9.vi":"The air was fresh, and the scenery was also beautiful.","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.9.vocab.0.vi":"air, atmosphere","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.9.vocab.1.vi":"fresh, clean","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.9.vocab.2.vi":"scenery, landscape, view","tests.0.skills.2.sections.1.passages.0.sentences.9.vocab.3.vi":"was beautiful"}}